 such a profitable, promising business why do these Venture capitalists, employees and DIIs sell their shares to me ??? They should enjoy their successful investment, am I wrong ?\n\nI welcome your views and clarity...", "like_count": 3, "author_id": "UCpxL3004RO39b70hxYPQaEg", "author": "@thelayman6189", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_ktRD_t5BwgXb1vfZYzGJkU1Q6NtLFeiFW4iRTZUUQ=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@thelayman6189", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1622505600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgwK-wS_dO2l_LRyYhB4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "https://youtu.be/eNBpmNXbTNM", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCOyX0WXRHXKUxj7Fc-KQRFg", "author": "@prasadjoshi7772", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n4cTyuD0CMNMv1oMIr6h-VD9OM3ydzMXMLpWuFaT0=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@prasadjoshi7772", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1622505600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyMdOrjFsJtQIJ9_Rd4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "Great great info, thanks alot sir.", "like_count": 2, "author_id": "UC_Hg9xKBdV4caFBXbb-Sd6Q", "author": "@adityaghorpade1475", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5d764Qw1T4iOcMqrXSB-QsQUNtpQvuRvxYFT3hFWPxDM=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@adityaghorpade1475", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1622505600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxNWlimEBVdsu0ritl4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "Excellent presentation & content. Can you please give information about GANDHAR OIL REFINERY LTD , unlisted Mumbai based Company\n. Thank you & Best Wishes.", "like_count": 1, "author_id": "UCNY_LCT-SCwRFGN_U_sET_g", "author": "@gorakhnat